Packages of FreeDCE
===================

The packages install everything below /opt/dce (libraries, programs,
headers), the systemd unit freedce-rpcd.service (not enabled) and the
directory /var/opt/freedce for the endpoint database of rpcd.  Remove a
manual installation in /opt/dce before installing them.

1. Source tarball (from a git checkout, the committed revision):

     packaging/make-tarball.sh <output dir> [revision]

   gives freedce-<version>.tar.gz and its .sha256.

2. Debian, Ubuntu (debhelper, dpkg-dev):

     tar xzf freedce-<version>.tar.gz && cd freedce-<version>
     cp -r packaging/debian debian
     dpkg-buildpackage -us -uc -b

   Packages: freedce (runtime, rpcd), freedce-dev (dceidl, headers),
   freedce-examples (echo and samr demos).  For a build per release, put
   the distribution into the Debian revision first (only letters, digits
   and dots, so that the file names stay unique and plain), e.g.
   "freedce (2.0.0-1deb13)" or "(2.0.0-1ubuntu24.04)" in debian/changelog.

3. Fedora, RHEL/AlmaLinux/Rocky 9 and 10, openSUSE (rpm-build,
   systemd-rpm-macros; EL9 also gcc-toolset-14):

     cp freedce-<version>.tar.gz ~/rpmbuild/SOURCES/
     rpmbuild -bb packaging/rpm/freedce.spec

   Packages: freedce, freedce-devel, freedce-examples.  openSUSE has no
   dist tag; give one, e.g. --define "dist .tumbleweed" or ".leap16".

4. Arch Linux (base-devel):

     cp packaging/arch/* <dir>; cp freedce-<version>.tar.gz <dir>
     cd <dir> && updpkgsums && makepkg --syncdeps

   One package freedce with all parts.

packaging/build-staged.sh is the build all of them use: dcethreads and
freedce, prefix /opt/dce, rpcd database in /var/opt/freedce, installed
into a staging directory (checked: no file names the stage).

Before the installation, check the downloaded files (in their directory):

     sha256sum -c --ignore-missing freedce-<version>-SHA256SUMS

Then install them with the package manager (apt install ./freedce*.deb,
dnf install ./freedce-*.rpm, zypper install --allow-unsigned-rpm
./freedce-*.rpm, pacman -U freedce-*.pkg.tar.zst) and start rpcd:

     systemctl enable --now freedce-rpcd
     /opt/dce/bin/echo_server &  /opt/dce/bin/echo_client -h localhost
